[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Gaffer is installed in %%PREFIX%%/lib/gaffer and is started with the
`gaffer` command.

This package does not include the Arnold, RenderMan and 3Delight renderer
integrations, which need these commercial renderers.

GafferML (the ML option) runs ONNX models on the CPU. The Inference node
looks for models given by a relative path in the directories listed in
GAFFERML_MODEL_PATHS.

Gaffer uses USD's Python bindings (the `pxr` module) to provide parameter
metadata for USD shaders and lights, and to select by USD kind in the
Viewer. graphics/openusd does not install them by default, in which case
these features are not available.
EOM
}
]
